VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'code? Let\'s find out. And guys, if you like these type of videos, be sure to like this video and hit subscribe. It really does help. Back in January 25, Deep Seek shook up'

[00:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the whole AI world with the release of R1, an opening reasoning model that\'s been trained on self-taught reinforcement learning, essentially meaning the model trained itself. This'

[00:48] [scene:talk]
