AUDIO: 'that need to be improved. For example, the whole process of installing plugins is a bit fiddly. There\'s no mention of tool discoverability like the tool search tool from Claude, but the biggest'

[07:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'problem of all is that Codium so the whole plugin architecture is solving a problem I\'d say never existed. I\'ve used a many harnesses in the past and the issue has never been the way plugins are'

[07:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'loaded and unloaded. I actually don\'t mind restarting my harness whenever I install a new plugin or whenever I need to do an update. And yes, it is pretty cool that technically the AI agent can'

